# Provider keys for this developer. Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in.
# Never commit .env.local. This file names the keys and holds no values.

OPENAI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Which model `make up` points every model name at. OpenAI is the default (needs OPENAI_API_KEY and a route to
# api.openai.com). Set DEMO_MODEL=fake to run on the local fake model: no key, no cost, no outside calls.
# DEMO_MODEL=fake
